"Alibaba. Instructions are prefixed with `th.` as described in the "
"specification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:432
msgid "`XTHeadBs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:434
msgid ""
"LLVM implements [the THeadBs (single-bit operations) vendor-defined "
