msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:436
msgid "`XTHeadCondMov`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:438
msgid ""
"LLVM implements [the THeadCondMov (conditional move) vendor-defined "
