msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:444
msgid "`XTHeadFMemIdx`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:446
msgid ""
"LLVM implements [the THeadFMemIdx (indexed memory operations for floating "
