msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:460
msgid "`XTHeadSync`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVUsage.md:462
msgid ""
"LLVM implements [the THeadSync (multi-core synchronization instructions) "
